/app/desktop/src-tauri/resources/control/*
!/app/desktop/src-tauri/resources/control/.gitignore
# the pruned DeepSeek Harness (MIT) is built by app/desktop/scripts/stage-harness.mjs
/app/desktop/src-tauri/resources/harness/*
!/app/desktop/src-tauri/resources/harness/.gitignore
# screenshots and checkpoints from the Mac rebuild live outside git (StrataSplit\evidence-archive)
/app/host/docs/evidence/
/app/host/docs/checkpoints/

# persona/ — the standing texts. Only the PII-free core (soul.md at repo root,
# persona/agent.md, persona/skill.md, persona/README.md, the *.example templates)
# is tracked. user.md (the owner's name), always.md (real /home paths) and
# owner-voice.md (his handles, his state, his posts) carry personal data:
# user.md and always.md are generated per box from their .example, like
# strata-*.json, and the voice file is the owner's own archive, box-local.
/persona/user.md
/persona/always.md
/persona/owner-voice.md

# DGX Spark build outputs and local venv (docs/DGX_SPARK_LINUX.md)
/terminal/out-spark/
/out-spark/
/terminal/build-spark/
/build-spark/
/terminal/build-vision-spark/
/build-vision-spark/
/terminal/.venv-build/
/.venv-build/

# The unpacked engine feed is a cache, not a source (33f775ef builds the fork's own
# engine). GitHub takes blobs up to 100 MB, so these three live local only, and each
# `git add -A` was re-staging them and costing a rejected push.
engine-feed/engine/*/strata
engine-feed/engine/*/strata-vision
engine-feed/engine/*/libcublasLt.so.*

# Rust build artifacts (5.5 GB of object files; the sources are what is tracked)
rust/target/

# Box-local: Clio's Moltbook heartbeat - the social client, not the store. The scripts live in
# this checkout untracked (the shape persona/user.md and persona/always.md use), and the systemd
# user units in ~/.config/systemd/user/strata-molt.* point at them.
tools/molt_loop.py
tools/molt_cron.sh
tools/molt_open.sh
tools/molt_focus.sh
tools/state/molt-state.json
tools/state/molt.log
graphify-out/
bench/p1/graphify-corpus/
bench/p1/slice/
